Chapter: EdVectorTest
  cites Foreword chapter Ed25519
  cites Foreword chapter Sha512

 Published vectors only. The SHA-512 digests are FIPS 180-4's, the key
 and signature are RFC 8032 section 7.1 TEST 1. Nothing here is read
 back off our own x86-64 output, so this file can tell a broken
 backend from a backend that merely agrees with itself.

